WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,450
I'm sorry you are sick

2
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:03,450
Are you waiting to be eaten without closing the door?

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:04,880
You are the one who is sick

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,310
Hum, if it weren't for you

5
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:09,260
How could I run out on my own?

6
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,660
When has it been?

7
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,660
Stop it all

8
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,500
Welcome to the unmanned holiday hotel

9
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,100
Does anyone need to check into the hotel?

10
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,500
I don’t even look at what time it is.

11
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,700
Some people actually want to make money

12
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:34,810
The loss outside can’t perceive our unexpectedness

13
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:36,810
I actually didn't come in here

14
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:40,040
What kind of talent is this? Hey, captain

15
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,240
Let's stay here for one night today

16
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:45,700
It's safe here

17
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:49,660
It saves me all the effort of publicity.

18
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,680
you already lived here

19
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,280
I slept here at noon

20
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:58,070
But now that you feel better, I’ll treat you to food

21
00:00:58,070 --> 00:00:59,270
It's delicious

22
00:00:59,270 --> 00:01:03,180
Of course you can actually cook food here

23
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,780
A total of 61g points were deducted

24
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:05,980
Please pay by card

25
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:06,980
Payment successful

26
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:08,980
It seems that the amount of fish is 2g points

27
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:11,580
I'll have to ask my dad to get some more ribs when I get back.

28
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:14,180
You can eat whatever you want then hehe

29
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:15,180
Sorry, Xuewei

30
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:16,180
There are no points in the card

31
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:17,780
Thank you for your hard work. Just be hungry all night.

32
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:20,050
It actually tastes really good when combined with rice.

33
00:01:20,050 --> 00:01:21,050
This plump rice

34
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:22,050
Beef Leg Chicken Leg

35
00:01:22,050 --> 00:01:24,300
I haven't even had a customer

36
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,900
The shop only needs one gold box

37
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:27,300
You can exchange it for 100g points

38
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,300
so cheap
